{
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "$schema": "https://docs.oasis-open.org/sarif/sarif/v2.1.0/errata01/os/schemas/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "grype",
          "version": "0.110.0",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-44487-node",
              "name": "StockMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-44487 high vulnerability for node package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The HTTP/2 protocol allows a denial of service (server resource consumption) because request cancellation can reset many streams quickly, as exploited in the wild in August through October 2023."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2023-44487\nSeverity: high\nPackage: node\nVersion: 10.8.0\nFix Version: 18.18.2,20.8.1\nType: binary\nLocation: /usr/local/bin/node\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2023-44487](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-44487)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2023-44487**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | node  | 10.8.0  | 18.18.2,20.8.1  | binary  | /usr/local/bin/node  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2023-44487](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-44487)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:generic/node@10.8.0"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.5"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2021-22883-node",
              "name": "StockMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2021-22883 high vulnerability for node package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Node.js before 10.24.0, 12.21.0, 14.16.0, and 15.10.0 is vulnerable to a denial of service attack when too many connection attempts with an 'unknownProtocol' are established. This leads to a leak of file descriptors. If a file descriptor limit is configured on the system, then the server is unable to accept new connections and prevent the process also from opening, e.g. a file. If no file descriptor limit is configured, then this lead to an excessive memory usage and cause the system to run out of memory."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2021-22883\nSeverity: high\nPackage: node\nVersion: 10.8.0\nFix Version: 10.24.0,12.21.0,14.16.0\nType: binary\nLocation: /usr/local/bin/node\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2021-22883](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2021-22883)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2021-22883**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | node  | 10.8.0  | 10.24.0,12.21.0,14.16.0  | binary  | /usr/local/bin/node  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2021-22883](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2021-22883)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:generic/node@10.8.0"
                ],
                "security-severity": "7.8"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "GHSA-3jfq-g458-7qm9-tar",
