                "markdown": "**Vulnerability GHSA-3jfq-g458-7qm9**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | tar  | 2.2.1  | 3.2.2  | npm  | /usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm/node_modules/node-gyp/node_modules/tar/package.json  | github:language:javascript  | [GHSA-3jfq-g458-7qm9](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-3jfq-g458-7qm9)  |\n"
